      "general": {
        "abstract": "The retreat of the glaciers, Hallstätter Gletscher and Gosaugletscher, has made it possible to analyze primary succession. This retreat makes it possible to watch ecosystems grow, and chrono sequences emerge that allow a space-for-time substitution of vegetation development.\r\n",
